Root cause:
The bug was caused by the `bcm_qspi_exec_mem_op` function not correctly handling SFDP (Serial Flash Discoverable Parameters) reads. Specifically, the function did not set the `mspi_read` flag to true for the SFDP read command (`SPINOR_OP_RDSFDP`), which led to failures in reading the basic flash parameter table when using the SFDP protocol.

